Curly braces
When you have a series of commands, you can use {} to expand them automatically
# create two folders: foo/ bar/
$ mkdir {foo,bar}

# This creates files foo/a, foo/b, ... foo/j, bar/a, bar/b, ... bar/j
$ touch {foo,bar}/{a..j}

